<scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
<head>Scope and Content
</head>
<p>Bennett, as Superintendent of Albemarle County Public Schools, writes to Estes to remind him of Virginia's Compulsory Attendance Law and asks that Estes send his child to school every day.
</p>
</scopecontent>

